        <title>纽扣电池更换教程</title>
        <link>https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/</link>
        <pubDate>Thu, 09 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/1775713744361.png" alt="Featured image of post 纽扣电池更换教程" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;常见样式1&#34;&gt;常见样式1
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;找到主板上纽扣电池位置 ，如图示例：&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image.png&#34;
	width=&#34;842&#34;
	height=&#34;556&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image_hu_9ac2a5cc2fcfc780.png 480w, https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image_hu_b06e5e454ce619f7.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;151&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;363px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;推动固定夹以释放电池&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;从底座中移除电池&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;安装 CR2032 纽扣电池，+ 符号朝上，确保固定器牢 固地固定电池&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/1775713744361.png&#34;
	width=&#34;746&#34;
	height=&#34;361&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/1775713744361_hu_52baaf537eb685f.png 480w, https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/1775713744361_hu_475f194d6be9313b.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;206&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;495px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;常见样式2&#34;&gt;常见样式2
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;将其连接线拔出，再插入&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;注：需要注意正反以及防呆接口位置&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image-1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1051&#34;
	height=&#34;891&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image-1_hu_13d0b8e2db94b1c9.png 480w, https://dsmggm.dpdns.org/%E7%BA%BD%E6%89%A3%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image-1_hu_a063d684b8c95e57.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;117&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;283px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
